  "description": {
    "en": "Wilson NXT Duo II is a hybrid combining Wilson NXT 16 / 1.30 mm with Luxilon Adrenaline 17 / 1.25 mm. It blends the soft, arm-friendly comfort and pocketing of NXT with the crisp, stable and controlled response of Adrenaline. An update to the original NXT Duo, this version replaces Enduro Pro with Luxilon Adrenaline. Installing Adrenaline in the mains produces greater durability and control, while installing NXT in the mains increases playability, feel and comfort.",

    "zh": "Wilson NXT Duo II 是一套由 Wilson NXT 16 / 1.30 毫米与 Luxilon Adrenaline 17 / 1.25 毫米组成的官方 Hybrid。NXT 提供柔和、Arm-Friendly 的舒适性、Pocketing 和力量，而 Adrenaline 则提供更加 Crisp、稳定和可控的聚酯响应。它是原版 NXT Duo 的升级版本，Luxilon Adrenaline 替代了旧款 Enduro Pro。Adrenaline 放在主线时，更强调 Durability、Control 和稳定；NXT 放在主线时，则更加偏向 Playability、Feel、Comfort 和 Pocketing。"
  },

